{"id": "DejdcxUiZfq", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Why does your reel get likes but no views? You're chasing the wrong number. 👀\n\nAdam Mosseri, head of Instagram, named the top 3 ranking signals: watch time, likes per reach and sends per reach. To reach new people (non-followers), sends matter most: when someone DMs your reel to a friend, Instagram reads it as useful.\n\nAlso: the first 3 seconds decide everything, and watermarked or reposted content gets pushed less than original work.\n\nFormula: strong hook + content so useful people send it.\n\nSend this to the friend who makes reels 📩\n\n#instagramtips #reelsgrowth #contentcreator #instagramalgorithm #techinhindi", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792155618, "like_count": 5, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140716138575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.542, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPpgSYVSO-UB2ns3Fk4-FfcR_Ac_wT0rs5ECPV2fqcv8mxqa8_e97ouY7jnVch0GbzCBvKWRd7529kibyyQxwDqDGcrG7sBVhDOdV8.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdpUEby0C5uVTg0wXifRHMguNBV2K8DVXXAQTqTKeh4A6hFIJGFG0MMt2yiV_AwpMhB7YtLrU5dTMVy6ikx-lZUh&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=rhs8dlI9aX0Q7kNvwHm7cVD&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=BCbAOEPCqBR0ugJM77un2Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTNi1mu9HI3lQG8ft97KYSFAdRFa8K0ZgZpGPKwY5J3rg&oe=6AF42D8A", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 58.542, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,appl